| Python + imports (TF + DWPose + S3FD eager) | 18s | 18s |
| Model load (UNet .pth 3.4GB + VAE + Whisper) | 34s | 52s |
| Avatar cache + runtime geometry (mmap) | 13s | 65s |
| Warmup (synthetic render) | 4.4s | 69s |
