## Remaining Warm Start Bottlenecks

| Phase | Time | Next optimization |
|-------|------|-------------------|
| Python imports (TF present) | ~3.8s | Remove TF — requires Docker rebuild (~2s saved) |
| Model load (UNet + VAE + Whisper) | ~6.7s | EBS provisioning, S3→tmpfs, or persistent process |
| Runtime geometry | ~0.54s | Already optimized |
| Warmup (cuDNN autotuning) | ~3.2s | Persistent process (cuDNN plans lost on restart) |
| **Total** | **~14.3s** | **Target: 2-3s** |

The model load (6.7s) and warmup (3.2s) are the dominant remaining costs.
Reaching 2-3s requires architectural changes (persistent process, GPU
snapshots, or warm pool) — not further micro-optimizations.

